  <title>Product hub</title>

  <p>The product hub opens from <gui>Product hub</gui> in most windows that
  list products, such as the right click menu of an invoice line, or with
  <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>H</key></keyseq>. It shows how many are
  <gui>On hand (all locations)</gui>, and each button opens another window
  already showing this product:</p>

  <list>
    <item><p><gui>Edit Product</gui>: <link xref="product_edit_main"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Product location</gui>: <link xref="products#location"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Product search</gui>: <link xref="product_search"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Product history</gui>: <link xref="product_history"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Product overview</gui>: <link xref="products"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Print label</gui>: <link xref="product_print_label"/></p></item>
  </list>

</page>
